  "text_pages": [
    "Special program < Campus Life >  Welcome to Kyungsung University(*)\n스킵네비게이션\n본문바로가기\n주메뉴바로가기\nKYUNGSUNG UNIVERSITY\nSpecial program\n메인으로 이동\nCampus Life\nAbout Kyungsung\nAdmissions\nAcademics\nCampus Life\nMember Service\nMy Page\nEtc\nSpecial program\nFacilities\nStudent Support\nInterview\nSpecial program\nCareer program\nCampus Life\nCampus Life\nFacilities\nStudent Support\nInterview\nSpecial program\nCareer program\nSNS 공유하기\n페이스북\n블로그\n트위터\n북마크\n인쇄\nSpecial Program\nDual Degree Program\nAfter two years of study at Kyungsung University, two more years at a foreign university with an agreement will be given a dual degree. Currently, our university has dual degree agreements with Qingdao University of China, East China Normal University, and XI An Fanyi University.\nExchange Program\nKyungsung University’s Exchange Student Programs offer opportunities to students who plan to study for a year or a semester at the campus located in the heart of Busan, the dynamic city of Korea. In addition to gaining academic excellence, international students are also exposed to a beautiful and culturally rich environment and can share special memories and experience Korean culture by participating in various Kyungsung activities for international students such as buddy programs, cultural field Trip, language tutoring programs and other. Generally, Kyungsung University offers Korean language classes as well as undergraduate courses both in Korean and English.\nBuddy+ Program\nBy matching foreign students and Korean students who are attending Kyungsung University, students can learn culture and language from each other while Korean students helping foreign students adapt to their life in Korea.\nOverseas Language Training Program Supported by Kyungsung\nA program to go to a partner university abroad during the vacation and do overseas language training and cultural exploration for three to four weeks.\nInternational Summer Camp\nInternational Summer School of Kyungsung University invites students from partner universities to take courses ever year. Every summer, Kyungsung University invites students to join us for an unforgettable summer in the heart of Busan. Students will make life-long friends, build new networks, expand and deepen your academic and cultural horizons, and experience life in Korea. Summer camp highlights growing interest in the arts, culture, and humanities while also offering Korean language classes.\nK-move School Overseas Employment Training Program\nKyungsung University has been selected as the operator of the K-Move School Overseas Employment Training Program organized by the Korea Industrial Manpower Corporation since 2015. Through this program, systematic overseas employment is supported.\nGlobal Lounge\nTo improve students' foreign language skills, the Global Lounge is opened as a resting place where only English can be used. Not only international students but also exchange students, professors, faculty members, and students can learn foreign culture and foreign language skills naturally. In addition, the Global Lounge offers movie DVDs and access to information related to overseas universities.\nExtra Curriculum\nThe course 'Life Design Project for Foreign Studies' is provided. It provides sports competitions and field trips for foreign students. And encourages Korean cultural experiences such as K-Movie and K-Food."
